        <updated>2026-09-10T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a id="w-node-b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d-bedec3de" data-w-id="b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d" data-wf-native-id-path="b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%226568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3c5%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa2b718ee89b0bda21be8f1%22%7D%5D" href="/blog/we-handed-halcyon-to-an-independent-firm-to-break-it" class="cms-card_item is-blog w-inline-block"><div class="cms-card_image-link"><div class="cms-card_image-wrapper is-blog"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aa2b689ed293adb93590c7d_Halcyon-blog-hero-DirectDefense-3rd-Party-report-1200x630.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aa2b689ed293adb93590c7d_Halcyon-blog-hero-DirectDefense-3rd-Party-report-1200x630-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aa2b689ed293adb93590c7d_Halcyon-blog-hero-DirectDefense-3rd-Party-report-1200x630-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aa2b689ed293adb93590c7d_Halcyon-blog-hero-DirectDefense-3rd-Party-report-1200x630.jpg 1200w" class="cms-card_image w-condition-invisible"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aa2b689ed293adb93590c7d_Halcyon-blog-hero-DirectDefense-3rd-Party-report-1200x630.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aa2b689ed293adb93590c7d_Halcyon-blog-hero-DirectDefense-3rd-Party-report-1200x630-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aa2b689ed293adb93590c7d_Halcyon-blog-hero-DirectDefense-3rd-Party-report-1200x630-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aa2b689ed293adb93590c7d_Halcyon-blog-hero-DirectDefense-3rd-Party-report-1200x630.jpg 1200w" class="cms-card_image"></div></div><div class="cms-card_meta-wrapper"><div fs-cmsfilter-field="date" class="text-style-date text-color-blue">Sep 10, 2026</div><div class="category-link is-outline"><div fs-cmsfilter-field="category">Industry</div></div></div><div class="cms-card_title-link"><h3 fs-cmsfilter-field="title" class="heading-style-cms-card">We Handed Halcyon to an Independent Firm and Told Them to Break It </h3></div><div class="cms-card_description"><p fs-cmsfilter-field="description" class="text-size-small truncate">We asked DirectDefense, an independent firm, to try to get ransomware past Halcyon: 519 unique in-the-wild samples plus 11 major families like LockBit, WannaCry, and Akira, 530 payloads total, each on a fresh, isolated Windows Server 2025 instance. Result: zero got through.&nbsp;</p></div><div class="cms-card_button-wrapper"><div data-w-id="7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ec" class="button-secondary"><div>Read the Blog</div><div class="button-secondary-icon-wrap"><div data-w-id="7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ef" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;" class="button-secondary-icon w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
